# spec: on the QC Ultra 2, set_cnc reads the live settings register [31.10] and writes it back with only the CNC level changed, keeping spatial, wind and ANC as read.
# source: NOTES.md, "The real CNC path: [31.10] AudioModesSettingsConfig" (5-byte payload [cnc, autoCNC, spatial, wind, anc]; autoCNC only 0). Synthetic: the settings read back (cnc 5, spatial head, wind on, ANC on), chosen so a write that does not keep them fails.
device qc_ultra2
call set_cnc 2
send 1f 0a 01 00
recv 1f 0a 03 05 05 00 02 01 01
send 1f 0a 02 05 02 00 02 01 01
recv 1f 0a 03 05 02 00 02 01 01
result ok
